# _common - Core utilities and constants for the extensions library
# Part of the dotfiles library v2.0
# Version: 1.0.0
#
# Usage:
#   source "${DOTLIB}/_common"
#
# Provides:
#   - _common's own storage namespace (docs/templates/command-cache)
